{"timestamp": "2025-08-15T15:35:01.428441", "function_name": "collect", "function_body": "  # Get the index for the specified primitive\n  primitive_index = env.world.cookbook.index[primitive]\n  \n  # Check if we already have it in inventory\n  if state.inventory[primitive_index] > 0:\n      return []\n  \n  # Find a path to the primitive\n  path_to_primitive = find_path_to_primitive(state, primitive_index)\n  \n  if not path_to_primitive:\n      # No valid path to collect this primitive\n      return []\n  \n  action_list = []\n  current_pos = state.pos\n  \n  for target_pos in path_to_primitive:\n      # Determine the direction to move\n      dx = target_pos[0] - current_pos[0]\n      dy = target_pos[1] - current_pos[1]\n      \n      if dx == 1: action = 3  # RIGHT\n      elif dx == -1: action = 2  # LEFT\n      elif dy == 1: action = 1  # DOWN\n      elif dy == -1: action = 0  # UP\n      else:\n          # Already at target position, check if we can collect\n          if state.grid[target_pos[0], target_pos[1], primitive_index] > 0:\n              # Collect the primitive using USE action\n              action_list.append(4)  # USE\n          break\n      \n      action_list.append(action)\n      current_pos = target_pos\n  \n  return action_list", "island_id": 8, "scores": {"3": -1}}
