{"timestamp": "2025-08-15T15:39:47.910245", "function_name": "collect", "function_body": "  # Find the index of the primitive\n  primitive_index = env.world.cookbook.index[primitive]\n  \n  # Check if we already have this primitive in inventory\n  if env._current_state.inventory[primitive_index] > 0:\n      return []\n  \n  # Get all positions where this primitive is available\n  positions = []\n  for x in range(env.world.WIDTH):\n      for y in range(env.world.HEIGHT):\n          if env._current_state.grid[x, y, primitive_index] == 1:\n              positions.append((x, y))\n  \n  if not positions:\n      return []\n  \n  # Simple pathfinding to the first available position\n  agent_pos = env._current_state.pos\n  target_pos = positions[0]\n  \n  action_list = []\n  while agent_pos != target_pos:\n      dx = target_pos[0] - agent_pos[0]\n      dy = target_pos[1] - agent_pos[1]\n      \n      if abs(dx) > abs(dy):\n          # Move horizontally first\n          if dx > 0:\n              action = craft.RIGHT\n          else:\n              action = craft.LEFT\n      else:\n          # Move vertically first\n          if dy > 0:\n              action = craft.UP\n          else:\n              action = craft.DOWN\n      \n      action_list.append(action)\n      agent_pos = (agent_pos[0] + (1 if dx > 0 else (-1 if dx < 0 else 0)),\n                   agent_pos[1] + (1 if dy > 0 else (-1 if dy < 0 else 0)))\n  \n  # Pick up the primitive\n  action_list.append(craft.PICKUP)\n  \n  return action_list", "island_id": 8, "scores": {"3": -1}}
