{"timestamp": "2025-08-15T15:47:35.973685", "function_name": "collect", "function_body": "  prim_idx = env.world.cookbook.index[primitive]\n  if env._current_state.inventory[prim_idx] > 0:\n    return []\n\n  # If we can craft it, do not collect directly\n  primitives_for_goal = env.world.cookbook.primitives_for(prim_idx)\n  if primitives_for_goal:\n    return []\n\n  # Find all positions of the primitive in the grid\n  positions = []\n  for x in range(env._current_state.grid.shape[0]):\n    for y in range(env._current_state.grid.shape[1]):\n      if env._current_state.grid[x, y, prim_idx] > 0:\n        positions.append((x, y))\n\n  # If we found the primitive, get path to it\n  if not positions:\n    return []\n\n  # Find the closest position\n  agent_pos = env._current_state.pos\n  min_dist = float('inf')\n  closest_pos = None\n  for pos in positions:\n    dist = abs(pos[0] - agent_pos[0]) + abs(pos[1] - agent_pos[1])\n    if dist < min_dist:\n      min_dist = dist\n      closest_pos = pos\n\n  # Now we need to find a path from the agent to this position\n  path = get_path(env, agent_pos, closest_pos)\n  if not path:\n    return []\n\n  # Convert path to actions\n  actions = []\n  for i in range(len(path) - 1):\n    current_pos = path[i]\n    next_pos = path[i + 1]\n    dx = next_pos[0] - current_pos[0]\n    dy = next_pos[1] - current_pos[1]\n\n    if dx == 1:\n      actions.append(3)  # RIGHT\n    elif dx == -1:\n      actions.append(2)  # LEFT\n    elif dy == 1:\n      actions.append(1)  # DOWN\n    elif dy == -1:\n      actions.append(0)  # UP\n\n  # Finally, add the pickup action at the destination\n  actions.append(4)  # USE to pick up the item\n  return actions", "island_id": 7, "scores": {"3": -1}}
